          "heading": "Common questions",
          "items": [
            {
              "q": "What areas do you serve from Atlanta?",
              "a": "We serve the Southeast within about 400 miles of Atlanta. Our daily lanes go to Charlotte, Nashville and Birmingham. We run to Jacksonville 3 times a week."
            },
            {
              "q": "What equipment do you use?",
              "a": "We run 53-ft dry vans. We also offer drop trailers, and we secure loads with load locks and straps."
            },
            {
              "q": "Can you leave a trailer at our warehouse?",
              "a": "Yes. We run drop-trailer programs. We leave a trailer at your dock and swap it when it is full."
            },
            {
              "q": "How fast do I get a quote?",
              "a": "Quotes are sent the same business day. Use the quote form or call dispatch."
            },
            {
              "q": "Are you insured?",
              "a": "Yes. We are fully insured, and we send a certificate of insurance on request."
            },
            {
              "q": "When is dispatch open?",
              "a": "Monday to Friday from 6:00 a.m. to 8:00 p.m., and Saturday from 7:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m."
            }
          ]
